flowchart TD
S([Visitor submits email and password]) --> V{Valid email and password at least eight characters?}
V -- No --> E[400 validation error; no account saved]
V -- Yes --> N[Normalize email and create salted password hash]
N --> C{Unique normalized email insert succeeds?}
C -- Duplicate --> D[409 duplicate; no second account]
C -- Yes --> A[Commit account and logical empty preferences]
A --> R[201 account id and email; no hash returned]
R --> F([Sign-in available immediately; no email verification])
